{"ticker":"NCLH","updated":"2026-11-07T01:41:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd.","shortName":"Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings ","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nclhltd.com","fullTimeEmployees":44500,"marketCap":8230216192,"trailingPE":9.900553,"forwardPE":12.616609,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.80982727,"pegRatio":1.47,"targetMeanPrice":19.56522,"targetHighPrice":26.0,"targetLowPrice":13.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.003,"earningsGrowth":0.243,"grossMargins":0.41396,"operatingMargins":0.21277,"profitMargins":0.08196,"totalRevenue":10162927616,"beta":1.964,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":25.13,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":13.63,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a cruise company in North America, Europe, the Asia-Pacific, and internationally. It offers itineraries to destinations, such as Europe, Asia, Australia, New Zealand, South America, Africa, Canada, Bermuda, the Caribbean, and Alaska; and inter-island itinerary in Hawaii. The company also provides features, amenities, and activities, including various accommodations, dining venues, bars and lounges, spas, casino and retail shopping areas, and entertainment choices; shore excursions at each port of call, and air transportation and hotel packages for stays before or after a voyage. It offers its products and services under the Norwegian Cruise Line, Oceania Cruises, and Regent Seven Seas Cruises brands. The company was founded in 1966 and is based in Miami, Florida.","summary_zh":"挪威郵輪控股有限公司及其子公司作為一家郵輪公司在北美、歐洲、亞太地區和國際上運作。提供前往歐洲、亞洲、澳洲、紐西蘭、南美洲、非洲、加拿大、百慕達、加勒比海、阿拉斯加等目的地的航線；以及夏威夷的島際行程。該公司還提供特色、便利設施和活動，包括各種住宿、餐飲場所、酒吧和休息室、水療中心、賭場和零售購物區以及娛樂選擇；每個停靠港的岸上遊覽，以及航行前後住宿的航空交通和酒店套餐。該公司以挪威郵輪、大洋洲郵輪和麗晶七大洋郵輪品牌提供產品和服務。該公司成立於 1966 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州邁阿密。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh"