google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-31","zh":"挪威郵輪 (NCLH) 第三季獲利超出預期後股價下跌"},{"title":"Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings (NCLH) Lifts 2026 Outlook After Q3 Beat And CFO Change","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"挪威郵輪控股公司 (NCLH) 在第三季業績和財務長變動後上調 2026 年展望"},{"title":"Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings (NYSE:NCLH) Stock Forecast & Analyst Predictions","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQRkhNc1lsZW1XTFJMMzIxZGs3LVVraUNaUUEyR3k2VVAwb0NFMnlqTDc4VFlxNEUxaWVFa3lxY3c2djE1anJDT2d0TXdodXh0OGJDUGhYV1pyU2RqR0hac01RdmJ4N1NBRGxMbF9wOXM3VktuamNxd0h3MmE1R2FPdXdOX3d4bkl2MVVqTzBTOVNVb1A2Y3c2dnZ1dktFdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"挪威郵輪控股公司（NYSE：NCLH）股票預測與分析師預測"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1513761/000110465926022067/nclh-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Norwegian commenced operations from Miami, Florida in 1966, launching the modern cruise industry by offering weekly departures from Miami, Florida to destinations in the Caribbean. In February 2011, NCLH, a Bermuda limited company, was formed. In January 2013, NCLH completed its initial public offering and the ordinary shares of NCLC were exchanged for the ordinary shares of NCLH, and NCLH became the owner of 100% of the ordinary shares and parent company of NCLC. In November 2014, we completed the acquisition of PCI.","zh":"挪威航空於 1966 年從佛羅裡達州邁阿密開始運營，每週提供從佛羅裡達州邁阿密出發前往加勒比海目的地的航班，開啟了現代郵輪業。 2011年2月，百慕達有限公司NCLH成立。 2013年1月，NCLH完成首次公開發行，NCLC的普通股換成NCLH的普通股，NCLH成為NCLC 100%普通股的所有者和母公司。 2014年11月，我們完成了對PCI的收購。"},{"en":"In late 2023, in response to the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development (\"OECD\")'s BEPS 2.0 Pillar 2 global tax reform, the Company restructured its organizational structure by realigning many of its operations across its three different brands into a single jurisdiction, Bermuda. In connection with the reorganization, among other steps, certain NCLH subsidiaries previously domiciled in the Isle of Man, the Cayman Islands, the Republic of the Marshall Islands, the Republic of Panama and the state of Delaware, were redomiciled to Bermuda.","zh":"2023年底，為了回應經濟合作暨發展組織（「OECD」）的BEPS 2.0第二支柱全球稅收改革，該公司重組了其組織結構，將其三個不同品牌的許多業務重新調整到一個司法管轄區——百慕達。在重組過程中，除其他步驟外，先前位於馬恩島、開曼群島、馬紹爾群島共和國、巴拿馬共和國和特拉華州的某些 NCLH 子公司已遷至百慕達。"},{"en":"Our brands offer itineraries to worldwide destinations including Europe, Asia, Australia, New Zealand, South America, Africa, Canada, Bermuda, Caribbean, Alaska and Hawaii. Norwegian's U.S.-flagged ship, Pride of America, provides the industry's only entirely inter-island itinerary in Hawaii.","zh":"我們的品牌提供前往全球目的地的行程，包括歐洲、亞洲、澳洲、紐西蘭、南美洲、非洲、加拿大、百慕達、加勒比海、阿拉斯加和夏威夷。挪威航空旗下悬挂美国国旗的游轮“美国之傲”号在夏威夷提供业内唯一的完全岛际航线。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our primary competition includes operators such as Carnival and Royal Caribbean, as well as other cruise lines such as MSC Cruises, Viking Ocean Cruises and Virgin Voyages. In addition, we compete with land-based vacation alternatives, such as hotels and resorts, vacation ownership properties, casinos, and tourist destinations throughout the world.","zh":"我們的主要競爭對手包括嘉年華和皇家加勒比等營運商，以及MSC Cruises、Viking Ocean Cruises和Virgin Voyages等其他郵輪公司。此外，我們還與世界各地的酒店和度假村、度假所有權物業、賭場和旅遊目的地等陸上度假替代品競爭。"},{"en":"Our largest capital expenditures are for ship construction and acquisition. Our largest operating expenditures are for payroll and related (including our contract with a third party who provides certain crew services), fuel, airfare, food and beverage, advertising and marketing and travel advisor services. Most of the supplies that we require are typically available from numerous sources at competitive prices. Our purchases for ship construction expenditures are generally denominated in euros and other purchases are denominated primarily in U.S. dollars. Payment terms granted by suppliers are generally customary terms for the cruise industry.","zh":"我們最大的資本支出用於船舶建造和收購。我們最大的營運支出是薪資及相關（包括我們與提供某些機組人員服務的第三方的合約）、燃油、機票、食品和飲料、廣告和行銷以及旅遊顧問服務。我們所需的大多數物資通常可以從眾多來源以具有競爭力的價格獲得。我们用于船舶建造支出的采购通常以欧元计价，其他采购主要以美元计价。供應商授予的付款條件通常是遊輪行業的慣例條款。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Passenger","val":6687667000,"zh":"乘客"},{"name":"Onboard & Other","val":3139925000,"zh":"船上及其他"}],"total":9827592000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":5649039000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Europe","val":2898886000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":996748000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Country","val":282919000,"zh":"其他國家"}],"total":9827592000}},"peers":["RCL","CCL","AAL","UAL","DAL"]}}